85
00:07:07.246 --> 00:07:08.121
Part 2.

86
00:07:08.401 --> 00:07:10.278
Core Concepts, Beginner to Deep.

87
00:07:11.528 --> 00:07:14.493
Intuition: the shopkeeper who finishes your sentence.

88
00:07:14.773 --> 00:07:23.605
A good shopkeeper hears Amul... and says butter? taaza milk? the things most people want, the things you usually buy, and nothing they don't have in stock.

89
00:07:23.885 --> 00:07:26.147
They don't think hard about it; they remember.

90
00:07:26.427 --> 00:07:30.779
Autocomplete is that memory, prepared in advance so the answer is instant.

91
00:07:32.129 --> 00:07:33.089
Requirements.

92
00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:34.222
Functional.

93
00:07:34.502 --> 00:07:40.433
Given a prefix (and user, city, store, language), return up to 5 to 10 suggestions, ranked.

94
00:07:40.713 --> 00:07:45.982
Suggestions from popular queries, the user's history, products, brands and categories.

95
00:07:46.262 --> 00:07:52.363
Handle spelling variants and scripts; exclude blocked, PII and zero-result suggestions.

96
00:07:52.643 --> 00:07:55.715
Update rankings daily, and trending terms within an hour.

97
00:07:57.065 --> 00:07:58.175
Non-functional.

98
00:07:58.455 --> 00:08:06.199
Server p99 10 ms; keystroke-to-render 150 ms p95 on mobile networks.

99
00:08:06.479 --> 00:08:11.684
Very high read QPS, tiny payloads, high cacheability for short prefixes.

100
00:08:11.964 --> 00:08:18.620
Availability 99.9%, autocomplete can degrade to no suggestions without breaking search.

