253
00:19:00.542 --> 00:19:12.894
Build per-language tries, or a trie over normalised keys: transliteration (aata, atta, आटा, then one key), with display strings per language (Ch 22 covered analyzers).

254
00:19:13.174 --> 00:19:25.953
Fuzzy prefixes: allow one edit on prefixes longer than 3 characters (amull b, then amul butter) with a bounded Levenshtein automaton over the trie, used only when exact matches are few.

255
00:19:26.233 --> 00:19:31.374
Keyboard-adjacency and phonetic variants for Indian names (paneer/panir).

256
00:19:32.724 --> 00:19:34.687
Safety and editorial control.

257
00:19:34.967 --> 00:19:42.903
Blocklists (slurs, adult terms, competitor names if policy says so), maintained by trust and safety and tested in the build.

258
00:19:43.183 --> 00:19:47.620
PII filters: phone numbers, emails, addresses, order ids.

259
00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:53.681
Thresholds: minimum distinct users per suggestion, so individuals can't plant suggestions.

260
00:19:53.961 --> 00:20:03.348
Manual overrides: pin (campaigns, events) and suppress (a recalled product) with an expiry, applied at serving time so they take effect immediately.

261
00:20:03.628 --> 00:20:07.105
