423
00:35:59.771 --> 00:36:13.446
K3: the debounce saved one request in six, because typing (median 180 ms a key) is slower than the 120 ms window, and it pushed the median wait to 184 ms.

424
00:36:13.726 --> 00:36:16.158
Tune debounce on real data, or skip it.

425
00:36:17.508 --> 00:36:25.593
K4: the edge answers the first three characters (1.70 hits per search) and the client reuses complete lists.

426
00:36:25.873 --> 00:36:35.815
Origin traffic dropped to 3.12 per search, and the p95 improved to 308 ms, better than K1's 479.

