5,000 customers, 30,000 week-5 searches; 6,000 global queries; 20 dark stores missing. ~15% of items each. method in top-5 keystrokes suggestions not. @1 char @4 @8 @12 to find in. the store.

439
00:37:49.850 --> 00:38:03.013
G1) global popularity 16.0% 16.5% 24.5% 47.4% 11.59 14.9%.

